# City-guard aggro-link help (10.x sub_39321C80 guard branch, PORTING "aggregate" row):
# a pirate attacking a protected-faction player next to a city guard pulls the guard.
#
# The victim bot (Haranya faction 109, guard_help t, not the zone's protected nation) spawns
# guard NPC 14148 (faction 162 "neutral guard", aggro_link_special_guard t, rule 4 everyone,
# non-aggressive, sight check) at its own position; the attacker bot takes the pirate faction
# 161 (hostile to the guard faction, so CanAttack accepts it) and melees the victim. Guard 14148
# does not aggro the pirate on sight (aggression false), so the join can only come from the
# guard-help rule. The victim's damage event must log the guard join (`ai::behaviors=debug`) and
# the guard must actually hit the attacker.
suite guard-help
bot victim gm
bot attacker gm

[victim]
targetself
gm setfaction 109
gm spawn npc 14148
pump 1
units 14148
waitpeer 120 ${attacker}
sync pos 2
sync ready 2
expectlog "guard help: joined the fight" 25
pump 2

[attacker]
targetself
gm setfaction 161
waitpeer 120 ${victim}
gopeer ${victim}
moverel 3 0 0
sync pos 2
sync ready 2
nattack 2 ${victim}
pump 5
